  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "6 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup melted shortening",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup cornmeal, or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_1Dyox6oHMoCAm-SdM2dwdZYWJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-1-3cfa814e66c84e548292e59267d7884a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm milk in a small saucepan until it bubbles, then remove from heat. Stir in sugar until dissolved and let cool until lukewarm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kSwSjzy6PKOPMb96yXjxY9n0qjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-2-0039-5e1f4d97de044f8c9c1f4b58323b175a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together warm water and yeast in a small bowl; let stand until creamy, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w7x2G_qtvugb3O9ociloR8NLP5s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-3-0045-9599c1bc469b4ceea194beb0731424d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine milk mixture, yeast mixture, 3 cups flour, and shortening in a large bowl; beat until smooth. Mix in salt and remaining 3 cups flour; knead until a soft dough forms. Place in a greased bowl, cover, and let rise in a warm place until doubled in volume, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9pkwaJF76GwjSd_gumGJkGHUcQg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-5-0098-5003a6473e044aa5af1c1584e9646e68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down dough. Roll on a lightly floured surface to about 1/2-inch thick. Cut rounds with a biscuit cutter, drinking glass, or empty tuna can.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3G3_A8MuAjMbtcyDyajQY4f6wec=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-6-0099-e1eb7f7b54f04dcab3dddf91c34d5291.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle cornmeal on waxed paper and place dough rounds on top. Dust tops with cornmeal, cover, and let rise for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fezVUbPze0kAF8Zt6MgPK1gg-lU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-English-Muffins-DDMFS-Step-6-0103-76ba96efd27d4a53b432de96b4c8b6d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a greased griddle over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook muffins on griddle until lightly browned, about 10 minutes per side. Split and toast as desired. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0u-_GmvLhASD_2VpuG8dRj90fG4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6947-EnglishMuffins-DDMFS-3x4-0157-6e693d0bac4e4e9dba611d9a004be119.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6947/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
